<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Interval signal of All-Union Radio</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1939</span><span class="sg-chain-h">opening notes played on vibraphone</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">German and Hungarian versions</span><span class="sg-chain-h">translation</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Zefir v shokolade (film)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">melody heard in the opening, alluding to Circus</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Igra na vyzhivanie (television series)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2020</span><span class="sg-chain-h">words recited in the opening titles</span></li></ul></section>
